    "Name": "Prism Pride Light",
    "Version": 1,
    "Author": "Duong Dieu Phap",
    "Description": "Prism Pride Light pairs hot pink outlines with warm gray details on a soft rose canvas. The toolbar and gallery share a translucent rose tint, while the viewer lets just a little of the window backdrop through. The familiar ImageGlass logo keeps its white ig lettering over six solid Pride stripes."
